  WHAT_DID_THE_PLANNER_RETURN -- "PLAN" --> IS_PLAN_APPROVED_BY_DEFAULT_Q
  WHAT_DID_THE_PLANNER_RETURN -- "PLAN<br/>difficulty 3 or less" --> IMPLEMENT_TASK
